  lines:
  - leftSpeaker: 0
    speakerName: Admiral Obi
    text: 'We detected another mothership near this area !

'
  - leftSpeaker: 1
    speakerName: Glorp
    text: Ooh, now that's some tricky battlefield. Well, kind of. Your movements
      will be limited, but those of the Metalheads as well...
  - leftSpeaker: 1
    speakerName: Glorp
    text: "I hardly believe you'll need them, but remember that there's Nitrogroove
      and healing tiles ! \n"
  - leftSpeaker: 1
    speakerName: Glorp
    text: 'Now, show these Metalheads what type of music is the best ! May the Groove
      be with you !

'
